      "number": 7,
      "originalText": "(a)\tthe following paragraph 1a is inserted:\n‘1a. The competent authority may decrease the amount of the penalty calculated in accordance with paragraph 1, considering one or more of the following factors:\na) the extent of unreported information;\nb) the level of cooperation and readiness of the authorised CBAM declarant to comply with requests for information;\nc) the unintentional nature of the behaviour of the authorised CBAM declarant;\nd) the past compliance of the authorised CBAM declarant.;’",
